<title>UK: Baring Asset Management names marketing chief.</title>
<headline>Baring Asset Management names marketing chief.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Baring Asset Management said on Wendesday it had appointed Mark Weber as global head of marketing.</p>
<p>He will be based in Boston and is expected to start in April. He was previously with Paribas Asset Management in New York.</p>
<p>BAM also named Mark Skinner as deputy head of marketing.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7770 (fax +44 171 583 7239)</p>
